flowchart LR
    A[Fast Read View] --> B[Browse / Discover / Estimate]
    B --> C{User Takes Action?}
    C -- No --> A
    C -- Yes --> D[Authoritative Validation]
    D --> E{Proof Exists?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Commit]
    E -- No --> G[Pending / Review / Block]
    F --> H[Replay Evidence]
    G --> H
